OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,CThis Evening and Tonight:FA short-
OL,6,Flived dry spell at first this evening
OL,7,Fbefore further cloud and heavy rain or
OL,8,Fshowers move eastwards across the
OL,9,Fregion from around midnight. Breezy,
OL,10,Fespecially along the coast.
OL,11,
OL,12,CThursday:FA few showers possible
OL,13,Finitially, but soon becoming largely
OL,14,Fdry with sunny spells. Cloud building
OL,15,Flater with rain arriving into the
OL,16,Fevening. Winds mostly light, but
OL,17,Fstrengthening later.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
