OL,3,GLondon & South East
OL,4,
OL,5,COutlook for Friday to Sunday:FUnsettled
OL,6,Fduring this period with showers or
OL,7,Flonger spells of rain throughout.
OL,8,FOften windy or very windy at times,
OL,9,Fwith a risk of gales. Temperatures
OL,10,Faround average.
